  description: Unlike ordinary reanimated remains, Skeleton Rogues retain traces
    of the agility and cunning possessed in life. Unburdened by exhaustion, fear
    or the limitations of living flesh, they are particularly dangerous adversaries.
    Their continued use of complex martial techniques remains a subject of fascination
    among scholars of the soul.
